commit 28d02b97064d04a54c2b8a66ba60ded9ff524728
Author: indkhan <mgsukhan@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Nov 1 04:19:05 2026 +0100

    Say what is still running after a result, as it stands then, and keep slow-request updates coming

    GPT-Live still added "still working on your rent" to a result on its own, which goes stale if rent finishes while Moneo is talking. Each result now tells it to say only that result; once Moneo has said it and nothing else is ready, the app says which requests are still running, read right then, and each only once.

    The one spoken update for a slow request also never came after the first result had been handed over, because it waited for a "current result" that never cleared. It now waits only while a result is being said.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Entire-Checkpoint: 01M6AHWC7K3D2S4GB3H2ABEESS

